    "remark": "Key Changes & Implementation:\n- Initial deployment of baseline model weights and bit-serial architecture.\n- Replaced absolute positional coordinates with Abacus Embeddings to enforce exact length generalization.\n- Implemented state-machine autoregressive trace decoding (Horner's method) to solve modular multiplication (a × b) mod p without hardcoded arithmetic.\n\nRelated Repositories:\n- Model Hub: https://huggingface.co/ameythakur/SAIR-Modular-Arithmetic-Challenge\n- Open-Source Laboratory: https://github.com/Amey-Thakur/SAIR-MODULAR-ARITHMETIC-CHALLENGE\n\nReferences & Prior Work:\n- Power et al.: Grokking phase transitions over delayed gradient steps.\n- McLeish et al.: Abacus Embeddings for mathematical place-value routing.\n\nAcknowledgements:\n- SAIR Foundation for challenge infrastructure.",
